#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Y.-A. Chen and Y. Xu, Equivalence between fermion-to-qubit mappings in two "
"spatial dimensions, [PRX Quantum 4, "
"010326](https://doi.org/10.1103/PRXQuantum.4.010326) (2023).\n"
msgstr ""
